---
// Quiz figure for go-structs-methods-interfaces set 01: three steps of c.IncValue(), showing the n each variable holds.
// It lists variables and values; it does not say why the caller's n stays the same.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq04rs">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 270" role="img" aria-label="Three steps of a call to c.IncValue(). Step 1: main holds c with n equal to 0. Step 2: inside IncValue there is a variable c with n equal to 1, and main's c has n equal to 0. Step 3: IncValue has returned, main's c has n equal to 0.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq04rs-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>c.IncValue(), step by step</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>c.IncValue(), từng bước</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="10" y="56" class="qfig-gq04rs-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. Before the call</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Trước khi gọi</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="205" y="56" class="qfig-gq04rs-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. Inside IncValue, after c.n++</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Trong IncValue, sau c.n++</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="440" y="56" class="qfig-gq04rs-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. After return</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Sau khi return</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="10" y="90" width="150" height="56" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04rs-cell" />
    <text x="85" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-c">main: c</text>
    <text x="85" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-m">n = 0</text>

    <rect x="205" y="90" width="150" height="56" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04rs-cell" />
    <text x="280" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-c">main: c</text>
    <text x="280" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-m">n = 0</text>
    <rect x="205" y="176" width="150" height="56" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04rs-hot" />
    <text x="280" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-c">IncValue: c</text>
    <text x="280" y="214" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-m">n = 1</text>

    <rect x="440" y="90" width="130" height="56" rx="6" class="qfig-gq04rs-cell" />
    <text x="505" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-c">main: c</text>
    <text x="505" y="124" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-m">n = 0</text>
    <text x="505" y="196" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>IncValue's c is gone</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>c của IncValue đã mất</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="505" y="214" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq04rs-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>(the call finished)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>(lời gọi đã xong)</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq04rs { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq04rs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq04rs text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq04rs .qfig-gq04rs-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04rs .qfig-gq04rs-t { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04rs .qfig-gq04rs-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04rs .qfig-gq04rs-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 15px; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq04rs .qfig-gq04rs-b { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq04rs-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq04rs-hot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; }
</style>
